<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">丁香书院联合校科协开展《软件基础编程实践》系列课程第二讲</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2023-11-29&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 11339)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:Calibri; panose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:微软雅黑; panose-1:2 11 5 3 2 2 4 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:"\@微软雅黑"; panose-1:2 11 5 3 2 2 4 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:blue; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#7E1FAD; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {mso-style-link:"批注框文本 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.a, li.a, div.a {mso-style-name:""; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} p.a0, li.a0, div.a0 {mso-style-name:""; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"批注框文本 Char"; mso-style-link:批注框文本; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} .MsoChpDefault {font-size:10.0pt;} @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p style="background: white; text-align: left; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 9.5pt;">&nbsp;<span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">为激发新生科创热情、拓展专业视野，11月22日丁香书院联合校科协于B楼434教室开展《软件基础编程实践》课程第二讲，本次课程主题为“网页前端入门”，共有200名学生报名参加。</span></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="620" height="464" id="图片 1" alt="IMG_256" src="/__local/7/39/9F/F714F9E9D59A3DD23834604C800_0AF81891_BA20.jpg" border="0" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/7399FF714F9E9D59A3DD23834604C800/0AF81891/BA20" vheight="464" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/7/39/9F/F714F9E9D59A3DD23834604C800_0AF81891_BA20.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">课程小导师王越洋首先为学生们介绍了VScode的基础功能和简单易懂的使用技巧，并通过实际的操作展示让同学们更加直观地了解和认识VScode。随后，在理解和认识VScode的基础上，课程小导师详细讲解了HTML标记语言，让学生们了解了网页的结构和常用标签的使用。同时，还介绍了CSS样式表，教授了如何掌握页面布局、样式设计和响应式设计等技巧。除此之外，课程小导师也讲解了可以实现网页动态效果的语言JavaScript，引导同学们学习如何使用JavaScript来实现一些基本的交互效果。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="620" height="464" id="图片 2" alt="IMG_257" src="/__local/F/46/E2/11CFFBFC75714A2F26387ACC936_F4C34377_AE4B.jpg" border="0" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F46E211CFFBFC75714A2F26387ACC936/F4C34377/AE4B" vheight="464" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/F/46/E2/11CFFBFC75714A2F26387ACC936_F4C34377_AE4B.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">最后，同学们在课程小导师的引导下进行了简单网页设计，将刚刚学会的VScode和基础编程技能应用在实践中。在实践操作环节，大家都表现出了极高的热情和专注度。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">《软件基础编程实践》课程的开展，不仅让学生们掌握了基础的编程知识，更是锻炼了实践能力和创造力，为后续参与创新项目奠定了基础。据悉，丁香书院将继续开展各类软件通识课程，为学生们提供更多学习和实践的机会。旨在让新生继续保持对科创的热情和兴趣，并在实践中不断探索和创新，在实践中学习、在学习中成长。</span></p>
</div>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
